# Nothing downloaded, generated or enormous belongs in the repository.

# The pinned QEMU tarball is 135 MB and the guest image another 90 MB, so unlike
# rtl-sim's 270 KB LitePCIe tarball they are *not* tracked. The pin is the
# version + sha256 in scripts/fetch-qemu.sh and scripts/fetch-guest.sh, and both
# scripts re-download on demand.
cache/

# The hand-driven guest run writes its serial console here.
guest-serial.log

# Bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
